<hr data-start=3D"5055" data-end=3D"5058" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"5060" data-end=3D"5094" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5064" data-end=3D"5094">5. Types de donn=C3=A9es en SQL</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5096" data-end=3D"5254" class=3D"">Les types de donn=C3=A9=
es sont utilis=C3=A9s pour sp=C3=A9cifier la nature des valeurs dans les co=
lonnes d'une table. Voici les types de donn=C3=A9es les plus courants dans =
SQL :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5256" data-end=3D"5729">
<li data-start=3D"5256" data-end=3D"5308" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5258" data-end=3D"5308" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
258" data-end=3D"5265">INT</strong> : Entiers (par exemple, <code data-star=
t=3D"5290" data-end=3D"5294">id</code>, <code data-start=3D"5296" data-end=
=3D"5306">quantit=C3=A9</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5309" data-end=3D"5398" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5311" data-end=3D"5398" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
311" data-end=3D"5322">VARCHAR</strong> : Cha=C3=AEnes de caract=C3=A8res d=
e longueur variable (par exemple, <code data-start=3D"5382" data-end=3D"538=
7">nom</code>, <code data-start=3D"5389" data-end=3D"5396">email</code>).</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5399" data-end=3D"5450" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5401" data-end=3D"5450" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
401" data-end=3D"5409">DATE</strong> : Dates (par exemple, <code data-start=
=3D"5432" data-end=3D"5448">date_naissance</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5451" data-end=3D"5534" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5453" data-end=3D"5534" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
453" data-end=3D"5464">DECIMAL</strong> : Valeurs num=C3=A9riques avec d=C3=
=A9cimales (par exemple, <code data-start=3D"5515" data-end=3D"5521">prix</=
code>, <code data-start=3D"5523" data-end=3D"5532">montant</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5535" data-end=3D"5583" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5537" data-end=3D"5583" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
537" data-end=3D"5548">BOOLEAN</strong> : Valeurs bool=C3=A9ennes (true/fal=
se).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5584" data-end=3D"5656" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5586" data-end=3D"5656" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
586" data-end=3D"5594">TEXT</strong> : Longues cha=C3=AEnes de caract=C3=A8=
res (par exemple, <code data-start=3D"5641" data-end=3D"5654">description</=
code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5657" data-end=3D"5729" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5659" data-end=3D"5729" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
659" data-end=3D"5671">DATETIME</strong> : Date et heure combin=C3=A9es (pa=
r exemple, <code data-start=3D"5712" data-end=3D"5727">date_creation</code>=
).</p>
</li>
