des parenth=C3=A8ses pour contr=C3=B4ler l'ordre d=E2=80=99=C3=A9valuation =
des conditions, car SQL suit la priorit=C3=A9 des op=C3=A9rateurs.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"5341" data-end=3D"5375" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5346" data-end=3D"5375">Priorit=C3=A9 des op=C3=A9rateurs :</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5376" data-end=3D"5498">
<li data-start=3D"5376" data-end=3D"5417" class=3D"">
