>AND</code></strong> est =C3=A9valu=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5451" data-end=3D"5498" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5453" data-end=3D"5498" class=3D"">Enfin, <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"5460" data-end=3D"5468"><code data-start=3D"5462" data-end=3D"5466">O=
R</code></strong> a la priorit=C3=A9 la plus faible.</p>
</li>
</ul>
