r cela, vous devez adapter la condition <code data-start=3D"3030" data-end=
=3D"3037">WHERE</code> de mani=C3=A8re =C3=A0 s=C3=A9lectionner plusieurs l=
ignes.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3083" data-end=3D"3136" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
