<hr data-start=3D"4724" data-end=3D"4727" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"4729" data-end=3D"4784" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4733" data-end=3D"4784">7. Utilisation de <code data-start=3D"4753" data-en=
d=3D"4761">DELETE</code> dans une transaction</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4786" data-end=3D"5076" class=3D"">Lorsqu=E2=80=99on trava=
