ous validerez les changements avec <strong data-start=3D"2959" data-end=3D"=
2971"><code data-start=3D"2961" data-end=3D"2969">COMMIT</code></strong>, s=
inon vous reviendrez en arri=C3=A8re avec <strong data-start=3D"3011" data-=
end=3D"3025"><code data-start=3D"3013" data-end=3D"3023">ROLLBACK</code></s=
trong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3028" data-end=3D"3031" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"3033" data-end=3D"3103" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3037" data-end=3D"3103">3. Utilisation de <code data-start=3D"3057" data-en=
d=3D"3076">BEGIN TRANSACTION</code>, <code data-start=3D"3078" data-end=3D"=
3086">COMMIT</code>, et <code data-start=3D"3091" data-end=3D"3101">ROLLBAC=
K</code></strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"3105" data-end=3D"3155" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3110" data-end=3D"3155">3.1. Exemple de transaction avec <code data-start=
=3D"3145" data-end=3D"3153">COMMIT</code></strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"3157" data-end=3D"3372" class=3D"">Imaginons un sc=C3=A9na=
