et la deuxi=C3=A8me table contient <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"kat=
ex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><m=
row><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex">M</annotati=
on></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hidden=3D"true=
