mantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hidden=3D"true"><span=
 class=3D"base"><span class=3D"strut" style=3D"height: 0.7667em; vertical-a=
lign: -0.0833em;"></span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal" style=3D"margin-ri=
ght: 0.10903em;">N</span><span class=3D"mspace" style=3D"margin-right: 0.22=
