 r=C3=A9soudre des probl=C3=A8mes complexes dans vos bases de donn=C3=A9es.=
</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"8139" data-end=3D"8176" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8144" data-end=3D"8174">R=C3=A9sum=C3=A9 des Concepts Appris</strong> :</h4=
>
<ul data-start=3D"8177" data-end=3D"8602">
<li data-start=3D"8177" data-end=3D"8308" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8179" data-end=3D"8308" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
179" data-end=3D"8198">FULL OUTER JOIN</strong> : Combine les r=C3=A9sultat=
s de <code data-start=3D"8226" data-end=3D"8237">LEFT JOIN</code> et <code =
data-start=3D"8241" data-end=3D"8253">RIGHT JOIN</code> et inclut toutes le=
s lignes, m=C3=AAme sans correspondance.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8309" data-end=3D"8397" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8311" data-end=3D"8397" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
311" data-end=3D"8324">SELF JOIN</strong> : Permet de joindre une table =C3=
=A0 elle-m=C3=AAme pour des relations r=C3=A9cursives.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8398" data-end=3D"8494" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8400" data-end=3D"8494" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
400" data-end=3D"8416">NATURAL JOIN</strong> : Effectue une jointure automa=
tique bas=C3=A9e sur les colonnes ayant le m=C3=AAme nom.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8495" data-end=3D"8602" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8497" data-end=3D"8602" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
497" data-end=3D"8516">UNION/UNION ALL</strong> : Combine les r=C3=A9sultat=
s de plusieurs requ=C3=AAtes, avec ou sans =C3=A9limination des doublons.</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
