trong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"579" data-end=3D"661" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"581" data-end=3D"661" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"581=
" data-end=3D"622">Manipulation de cha=C3=AEnes de caract=C3=A8res</strong>=
 (couper, rechercher, remplacer, etc.).</p>
