349" data-end=3D"1356">INT</strong> : Entiers (par exemple, <code data-star=
t=3D"1381" data-end=3D"1384">1</code>, <code data-start=3D"1386" data-end=
=3D"1391">100</code>, <code data-start=3D"1393" data-end=3D"1398">-45</code=
>).</p>
</li>
