<p data-start=3D"1403" data-end=3D"1489" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
403" data-end=3D"1414">VARCHAR</strong> ou <strong data-start=3D"1418" data=
-end=3D"1426">TEXT</strong> : Cha=C3=AEnes de caract=C3=A8res (par exemple,=
 <code data-start=3D"1465" data-end=3D"1476">'Bonjour'</code>, <code data-s=
tart=3D"1478" data-end=3D"1487">'12345'</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1490" data-end=3D"1579" class=3D"">
