e.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7224" data-end=3D"7500">
<li data-start=3D"7224" data-end=3D"7377" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7226" data-end=3D"7377" class=3D"">Si vous utilisez <code =
data-start=3D"7243" data-end=3D"7249">LIKE</code> avec un caract=C3=A8re de=
