t=3D"7320" data-end=3D"7333">LIKE '%abc'</code>), l'index ne sera g=C3=A9n=
=C3=A9ralement pas utilis=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7378" data-end=3D"7500" class=3D"">
