<p data-start=3D"2687" data-end=3D"2731" class=3D"">=E2=9A=A0 <strong data-=
start=3D"2689" data-end=3D"2727">L'ordre des colonnes est important</strong=
> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2732" data-end=3D"2896">
<li data-start=3D"2732" data-end=3D"2820" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2734" data-end=3D"2820" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99index <code d=
ata-start=3D"2742" data-end=3D"2769">idx_nom_ville(nom, ville)</code> est <=
strong data-start=3D"2774" data-end=3D"2783">utile</strong> pour <code data=
-start=3D"2789" data-end=3D"2794">nom</code> seul ou <code data-start=3D"28=
03" data-end=3D"2817">(nom, ville)</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2821" data-end=3D"2896" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2823" data-end=3D"2896" class=3D"">Il <strong data-start=
=3D"2826" data-end=3D"2849">ne sera pas utilis=C3=A9</strong> pour une rech=
erche <strong data-start=3D"2869" data-end=3D"2895">uniquement sur <code da=
ta-start=3D"2886" data-end=3D"2893">ville</code></strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2898" data-end=3D"2901" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2903" data-end=3D"2964" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2906" data-end=3D"2962">3. Types d'index et leur impact sur les performance=
s</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"2966" data-end=3D"3039" class=3D"">SQL propose plusieurs t=
ypes d'index, chacun adapt=C3=A9 =C3=A0 des cas sp=C3=A9cifiques.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3041" data-end=3D"3079" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3045" data-end=3D"3079">3.1. Index B-Tree (par d=C3=A9faut)</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3080" data-end=3D"3252">
<li data-start=3D"3080" data-end=3D"3144" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3082" data-end=3D"3144" class=3D"">Le plus utilis=C3=A9 (o=
ptimis=C3=A9 pour les recherches <code data-start=3D"3128" data-end=3D"3131=
">=3D</code> et <code data-start=3D"3135" data-end=3D"3138">&lt;</code>, <c=
ode data-start=3D"3140" data-end=3D"3143">&gt;</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3145" data-end=3D"3191" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3147" data-end=3D"3191" class=3D"">Structure =C3=A9quilibr=
=C3=A9e avec recherche rapide</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3192" data-end=3D"3252" class=3D"">
