<p data-start=3D"4804" data-end=3D"5025" class=3D"">Chaque index doit =C3=
=AAtre mis =C3=A0 jour lors d'une insertion ou modification de donn=C3=A9es=
.<br data-start=3D"4886" data-end=3D"4889">
=E2=9D=8C <strong data-start=3D"4891" data-end=3D"4929">Ne pas indexer tout=
es les colonnes</strong><br data-start=3D"4929" data-end=3D"4932">
