end=3D"4991">utilis=C3=A9es fr=C3=A9quemment</strong> dans <code data-start=
=3D"4997" data-end=3D"5004">WHERE</code>, <code data-start=3D"5006" data-en=
d=3D"5012">JOIN</code>, <code data-start=3D"5014" data-end=3D"5024">ORDER B=
Y</code>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5027" data-end=3D"5083" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5031" data-end=3D"5083">4.2. Index inutilis=C3=A9s =3D gaspillage de ressou=
rces</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5084" data-end=3D"5120" class=3D"">V=C3=A9rifiez les index=
 inutilis=C3=A9s avec :</p>
