<h2 data-start=3D"3563" data-end=3D"3608" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3566" data-end=3D"3606">6. Avantages et limitations des vues</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3610" data-end=3D"3643" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3614" data-end=3D"3641">6.1. Avantages des vues</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3644" data-end=3D"3938" class=3D"">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-=
start=3D"3646" data-end=3D"3677">Simplification des requ=C3=AAtes</strong> =
: Masque la complexit=C3=A9 des jointures et filtres<br data-start=3D"3725"=
 data-end=3D"3728">
=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"3730" data-end=3D"3742">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9<=
/strong> : Restreint l=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s aux donn=C3=A9es sensibles<br dat=
a-start=3D"3784" data-end=3D"3787">
=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"3789" data-end=3D"3808">R=C3=A9utilisabilit=
=C3=A9</strong> : =C3=89vite d=E2=80=99=C3=A9crire plusieurs fois la m=C3=
=AAme requ=C3=AAte<br data-start=3D"3856" data-end=3D"3859">
=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"3861" data-end=3D"3891">Mises =C3=A0 jour e=
n temps r=C3=A9el</strong> : Les donn=C3=A9es affich=C3=A9es sont toujours =
=C3=A0 jour</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3940" data-end=3D"3975" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3944" data-end=3D"3973">6.2. Limitations des vues</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3976" data-end=3D"4178" class=3D"">=E2=9A=A0 <strong data-=
start=3D"3978" data-end=3D"4020">Certaines vues ne sont pas modifiables</st=
rong>, surtout si elles contiennent des <strong data-start=3D"4055" data-en=
d=3D"4096">agr=C3=A9gats (<code data-start=3D"4067" data-end=3D"4072">SUM</=
code>, <code data-start=3D"4074" data-end=3D"4079">AVG</code>) ou <code dat=
a-start=3D"4084" data-end=3D"4094">DISTINCT</code></strong><br data-start=
=3D"4096" data-end=3D"4099">
=E2=9A=A0 <strong data-start=3D"4101" data-end=3D"4132">Impact sur les perf=
ormances</strong> si la vue repose sur des requ=C3=AAtes complexes</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4180" data-end=3D"4183" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4185" data-end=3D"4207" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4188" data-end=3D"4205">7. Conclusion</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4209" data-end=3D"4450" class=3D"">Les vues sont un outil =
puissant en SQL pour organiser, s=C3=A9curiser et simplifier les acc=C3=A8s=
 aux donn=C3=A9es. En les ma=C3=AEtrisant, vous pouvez structurer vos bases=
