<h3 data-start=3D"3180" data-end=3D"3212" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3184" data-end=3D"3212">2.3. Types de Privil=C3=A8ges</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3214" data-end=3D"3304" class=3D"">Les privil=C3=A8ges peu=
vent =C3=AAtre divis=C3=A9s en plusieurs cat=C3=A9gories selon les actions =
autoris=C3=A9es :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"3306" data-end=3D"3855">
<li data-start=3D"3306" data-end=3D"3537" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3309" data-end=3D"3350" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
309" data-end=3D"3350">Droits d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 la base de donn=
=C3=A9es :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3354" data-end=3D"3537">
<li data-start=3D"3354" data-end=3D"3394" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3356" data-end=3D"3394" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"335=
6" data-end=3D"3364">SELECT</code> : Permet de lire les donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3398" data-end=3D"3440" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3400" data-end=3D"3440" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"340=
0" data-end=3D"3408">INSERT</code> : Permet d=E2=80=99ajouter des donn=C3=
=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3444" data-end=3D"3488" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3446" data-end=3D"3488" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"344=
6" data-end=3D"3454">UPDATE</code> : Permet de modifier les donn=C3=A9es.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3492" data-end=3D"3537" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3494" data-end=3D"3537" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"349=
4" data-end=3D"3502">DELETE</code> : Permet de supprimer des donn=C3=A9es.<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3539" data-end=3D"3751" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3542" data-end=3D"3571" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
542" data-end=3D"3571">Droits d'administration :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3575" data-end=3D"3751">
<li data-start=3D"3575" data-end=3D"3642" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3577" data-end=3D"3642" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"357=
7" data-end=3D"3585">CREATE</code> : Permet de cr=C3=A9er des tables, vues,=
 ou bases de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3646" data-end=3D"3688" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3648" data-end=3D"3688" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"364=
8" data-end=3D"3654">DROP</code> : Permet de supprimer des objets.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3692" data-end=3D"3747" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3694" data-end=3D"3747" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"369=
4" data-end=3D"3701">ALTER</code> : Permet de modifier la structure des obj=
ets.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3752" data-end=3D"3855" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3755" data-end=3D"3778" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
755" data-end=3D"3778">Autres privil=C3=A8ges :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3782" data-end=3D"3855">
<li data-start=3D"3782" data-end=3D"3855" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3784" data-end=3D"3855" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"378=
4" data-end=3D"3793">EXECUTE</code> : Permet d'ex=C3=A9cuter des proc=C3=A9=
dures stock=C3=A9es et des fonctions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3857" data-end=3D"3860" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3862" data-end=3D"3889" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3865" data-end=3D"3889">3. Gestion des R=C3=B4les</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3891" data-end=3D"3921" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3895" data-end=3D"3921">3.1. Cr=C3=A9ation de R=C3=B4les</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3923" data-end=3D"4140" class=3D"">Un r=C3=B4le est un ens=
emble de privil=C3=A8ges qui peuvent =C3=AAtre attribu=C3=A9s =C3=A0 des ut=
ilisateurs ou =C3=A0 d'autres r=C3=B4les. Cela permet de simplifier la gest=
ion des permissions, surtout dans un environnement avec plusieurs utilisate=
urs.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4142" data-end=3D"4164" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4147" data-end=3D"4164">En PostgreSQL</strong></h4>
