<h3 data-start=3D"3793" data-end=3D"3853" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3797" data-end=3D"3853">2.2. Utilisation des ORM (Object-Relational Mapping=
)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3855" data-end=3D"4200" class=3D"">Les frameworks ORM (par=
 exemple, <strong data-start=3D"3888" data-end=3D"3902">Django ORM</strong>=
