<li data-start=3D"8264" data-end=3D"8363" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8266" data-end=3D"8363" class=3D"">Utiliser un <strong dat=
a-start=3D"8278" data-end=3D"8315">pare-feu d'applications web (WAF)</stron=
g> et <strong data-start=3D"8319" data-end=3D"8362">s=C3=A9curiser le serve=
ur de base de donn=C3=A9es</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8364" data-end=3D"8478" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8366" data-end=3D"8478" class=3D"">Tester r=C3=A9guli=C3=
=A8rement vos applications avec des outils d'analyse de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 =
et effectuer des <strong data-start=3D"8459" data-end=3D"8477">revues de co=
de</strong>.</p>
